,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞251字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（六　)開始朗讀，在表格中記錄1分鐘朗讀的字數。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以多練幾次。最後一次，找一位同學請他計時、記錄並簽名！","n":80,"ssz":".................................................................1.............."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"然而，阿政看的這兩部影片都有問題，影片製作者的描","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE），聚光燈內共 10 個","n":37,"ssz":"....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"網路上的影片只要出現實驗器材、明顯的研究結果，再加上說話者充滿信心，就很容易讓人覺得：「有做實驗，應該是真的吧！」\n可是，看起來「像」科學，不代表結論真的有科學根據。\n看到讓你驚訝、害怕或很想相信的訊息時，先不要急著相信或轉傳，可以用下面四個步驟檢查。\n網路訊息判讀四步驟\n❶抓主張：這則訊息要我相信什麼？\n❷查來源：是誰發布的？有沒有說明資料從哪裡來？\n❸驗證據：他拿什麼來證明？證據能支持結論嗎？\n❹再查證：其他可靠來源怎麼說？證據不足時，先保留判斷。\n※祕訣：判斷證據時，可以再問三個問題：\n1.他實際測到的是什麼？\n2.他最後下了什麼結論？\n3.測到的結果，真的能證明這個結論嗎？","n":294,"ssz":".........................................1............................1.........................1.......1...1...........1...........................1...............................................................................................1............................................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"網路上的影片只要出現實驗器材、明顯的研究結果，再加上說話者充滿信心，就很容易讓人覺得：「有做實驗，應該是真的吧！」","n":57,"ssz":".........................................1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"可是，看起來「像」科學，不代表結論真的有科學根據。","n":25,"ssz":"............1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到讓你驚訝、害怕或很想相信的訊息時，先不要急著相信或轉傳，可以用下面四個步驟檢查。","n":42,"ssz":"............1.......1...1...........1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"網路訊息判讀四步驟","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶抓主張：這則訊息要我相信什麼？","n":16,"ssz":"...........1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷查來源：是誰發布的？有沒有說明資料從哪裡來？","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸驗證據：他拿什麼來證明？證據能支持結論嗎？","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹再查證：其他可靠來源怎麼說？證據不足時，先保留判斷。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"※祕訣：判斷證據時，可以再問三個問題：","n":19,"ssz":"...............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.他實際測到的是什麼？","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.他最後下了什麼結論？","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.測到的結果，真的能證明這個結論嗎？","n":19,"ssz":"..............1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、跟著做：判讀「棉花肺實驗」","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"影片中，網紅把紙菸和電子煙的煙霧分別導入兩團棉花。紙菸使棉花變成深褐色，電子煙的棉花仍然潔白。網紅藉此讓觀眾相信電子煙比較安全。","n":64,"ssz":".........1............................................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶抓主張：影片要觀眾相信什麼結論？","n":17,"ssz":"..........1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紙菸會使棉花變色","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"電子煙不會使棉花變色，所以對人體無害","n":18,"ssz":"...1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"棉花可以吸收各種煙霧","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"電子煙的味道比紙菸好聞","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷查來源：影片提供了哪些來源資訊？\n影片是否說明這項實驗來自哪一個研究機構，或引用哪一份醫學研究？","n":49,"ssz":"................................1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷查來源：影片提供了哪些來源資訊？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"影片是否說明這項實驗來自哪一個研究機構，或引用哪一份醫學研究？","n":31,"ssz":"..............1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有，資料來源交代得很完整","n":12,"ssz":"........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒有，文章中未提到查證的研究來源","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因此，可以先判斷：這部影片的資料來源【　】。","n":22,"ssz":"...............